  "body_text": "不知道为啥一个新品定时上架时遭遇监管\n所以就改成接龙方式透出了\n等待着一大群人的到来~~\n淘宝 7.17 - 7.19 造物节\n平台活动有跨店满减（适合多店凑单撸）\n店铺自发有200-30大额券（限时，会员）\n有赞和微店已同步券的部分，平台的跨店满减无法。",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          不知道为啥一个新品定时上架时遭遇监管\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          所以就改成接龙方式透出了\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SDkPWqqibJMjg5sEUP7amleXtrqLyupNrRpS8o7GFvaMCH0C3JpgV723MkBiapxolXIyLfLprxrBJw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 349px;height: 610px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          等待着一大群人的到来~~\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          淘宝 7.17 - 7.19 造物节\n         </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            平台活动有跨店满减（适合多店凑单撸）\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            店铺自发有200-30大额券（限时，会员）\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          有赞和微店已同步券的部分，平台的跨店满减无法。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"width: 396px;height: 168px;\"/>\n</p>\n</div>",
